mockedUuidv4 = mocked(uuidv4) and const mockedGetUserFromSession =
mocked(getUserFromSession), then replace uuidv4.mockReturnValue(...) and
getUserFromSession.mockReturnValue(...) with mockedUuidv4.mockReturnValue(...)
and mockedGetUserFromSession.mockReturnValue(...); keep the beforeEach block and
existing mock return values unchanged.
```

</details>

